---
const readmeUrl = "https://github.com/jeremym/clipy-secure#how-the-privacy-works";
---

<section class="privacy" id="privacy" aria-labelledby="privacy-heading">
  <div class="privacy__heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy, concretely</p>
    <h2 id="privacy-heading">Sensitive history stays encrypted and local.</h2>
    <p>
      Clipy Secure is designed around the reality that a clipboard manager sees private things.
      Its safeguards are implementation choices, not vague promises.
    </p>
    <a href={readmeUrl}>Read the technical explanation <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>

  <div class="privacy__details">
    <dl>
      <div>
        <dt>AES-GCM encryption</dt>
        <dd>Clipboard fields are encrypted before they reach SQLite. The encryption key stays in your login Keychain.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Search that leaves no index behind</dt>
        <dd>The full-text index exists only in memory and is rebuilt from decrypted history when the app launches.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>No network features</dt>
        <dd>The app has no telemetry, sync, update check, or other networking feature.</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>

    <aside class="privacy__note" aria-labelledby="privacy-note-heading">
      <h3 id="privacy-note-heading">The honest boundaries</h3>
      <p>
        Snippets are intentionally stored as plaintext and export as plaintext XML—do not keep secrets in them.
        Clipy Secure has not received an independent security audit, and local encryption cannot protect a live
        clipboard on an already-compromised, unlocked Mac.
      </p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .privacy {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(24rem, 1.2fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    width: min(100% - 2rem, 74rem);
    margin-inline: auto;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--color-border, #2c3935);
    padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 7rem);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--color-accent, #6ee7c5);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 720;
    letter-spacing: 0.11em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h2 {
    max-width: 13ch;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text, #f5f7f6);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    line-height: 1.06;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .privacy__heading > p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 35rem;
    margin: 1.35rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, #b5c0bd);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .privacy__heading a {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--color-accent, #6ee7c5);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 670;
    text-underline-offset: 0.22em;
  }

  dl {
    margin: 0;
  }

  dl > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(8rem, 0.7fr) minmax(0, 1.3fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border, #2c3935);
    padding-block: 1.4rem;
  }

  dl > div:first-child {
    border-top: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  dt {
    color: var(--color-text, #f5f7f6);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 680;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, #b5c0bd);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.58;
  }

  .privacy__note {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, #d8a55c 36%, var(--color-border, #2c3935));
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: 1.2rem 1.3rem;
    background: rgba(184, 121, 40, 0.07);
  }

  .privacy__note h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.45rem;
    color: #efc582;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .privacy__note p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, #b5c0bd);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .privacy {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    h2 {
      max-width: 16ch;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .privacy {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      width: min(100% - 1.25rem, 74rem);
    }

    dl > div {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.45rem;
    }
  }
</style>
